      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing a Key Service**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud KMS for the managed key service. Now, I need to figure out the best way to incorporate the KMS identification within the `decrypt_payload.py` script itself. My next step involves researching best practices for this integration.\n\n\n**Defining the Decryption Function**\n\nI'm now outlining the `decrypt_payload.py` structure. The central function, `decrypt_payload`, will accept project details, key identifiers, and ciphertext. I'll utilize the `google-cloud-kms` client for the decryption itself within this function. The next step is writing out the necessary imports and initializing the client.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789859916687,
          "start": 1789859914859
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf6e46b001fxaBMuJgW3oHOe",
      "message_id": "msg_0bbf6dfe20018oJhz4wgSgcun9",
